    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "（運輸舶一艘但シ英國形）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "（運輸舶　一艘　但し英国形）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Transport vessel: one ship, with the qualifier that it is of English build. The third glyph is 舶, not 船. Its right-hand component is 白 — a short tick above a box divided by one horizontal bar — and not the 八-over-口 of 船, which would show two strokes splaying apart at the top. The glyph is heavily inked, so I confirmed it by thresholding at five levels and rendering at eight-times magnification; the strokes separate cleanly at threshold 60. Hansei ichiran uses both 舶 and 船 for vessels elsewhere in the survey, so the two must be kept apart."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "運輸船"
      }
